{{nodes.fix.result.reply}}

**Land — gate re-run then commit (exit {{nodes.land.result.exitCode}}):**
{{nodes.land.result.stdout}}
{{nodes.land.result.stderr}}

A non-zero land exit means the gate was still red and NOTHING was committed. That is the guard working, not a crash.
